{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15101100","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15101100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1510110001:1":{"text":"여긴 왜요? 벽화가 좀 벗겨진 것뿐인데...","source_cn":"这里怎么了？只是壁画剥落了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3563B80DB5ECF2DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1510110002:1":{"text":"이곳은 한때 완전한 두루마리였지만, 지금은 너희가 보고 있는 이 부분만 남아 있어.","source_cn":"这里曾经是一幅完整的长卷，但现在只留下了你们所见的这一部分。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D56EACB2358385","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1510110003:1":{"text":"여정의 두루마리는 처음부터 벗겨지는 걸 방지하기 위해 마법이 걸려 있었어. 사트라나가 이건 정말로 심각한 흉조라고 하더라.","source_cn":"行迹长卷自诞生之初，就被施加了防止剥落的魔法。在萨忒娜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64738259FDB1A560","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510110004:1":{"text":"존재가 지워지고, 시간이 사라지는 것은 바로 과거의 재앙이 다시 일어난다는 징조예요! 정말 끔찍한 일이 일어날 거라고 경고하는 거죠!","source_cn":"存在被抹除，岁月被吞噬，这不正是过去灾厄重现的预示吗？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72157AD253A34230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510110005:1":{"text":"게다가 만약 이 두루마리의 훼손 정도가 그리 심각하지 않은 거라면, 마지막 세 번째 두루마리는 더...","source_cn":"而且，如果说这一卷只是轻度剥落，那最后的第三卷更是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1772E169A5FCEEB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:安丹德拉":{"text":"안탄드라","source":"安丹德拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨忒娜":{"text":"사트라나","source":"萨忒娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":3}}